      "created_at": "2013-02-05T07:23:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It is infact pure-cooperative, sure you can screw over your friends if you really wanted to in it. But you could do that in SotM too where you attack your fellow heroes. It's a game where you either all win or all lose. Can't really say too much more or else I may getting a lashing.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Any comment on how many cards will there be ? Like how big the game is?</p>\n<p>I like that the miniatures are not necessary. Would be interesting if its like FTL in a card game.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
